# Gallery grid derivatives: 39MB, fully derivable, and the build
# regenerates them from whatever photos it actually has (34 of the live
# gallery photos are downloaded from Drive at build time and have never
# been in git). See scripts/build-grid-variants.mjs.
public/assets/grid/

# The client portal's mosaic sheet: one sprite of 120 photographs, rebuilt by
# the build from whatever photos it actually has, for the same reason as the
# grid derivatives above. See scripts/build-portal-mosaic.mjs.
public/assets/portal/
